<a href="tel:+640210507729" title="+640210507729" target="_self">0210 507 729</a></h6></div></div></div></div></div></div></header><div class="content clearfix"><div class="fl-builder-content fl-builder-content-17 fl-builder-content-primary fl-builder-global-templates-locked" data-post-id="17"><div class="fl-row fl-row-fixed-width fl-row-bg-none fl-node-2fb6qka3z4u8 fl-row-default-height fl-row-align-center" data-node="2fb6qka3z4u8"><div class="fl-row-content-wrap"><div class="fl-row-content fl-row-fixed-width fl-node-content"><div class="fl-col-group fl-node-mh8atky5x9fb" data-node="mh8atky5x9fb"><div class="fl-col fl-node-l03xatp9robh fl-col-bg-color fl-col-small" data-node="l03xatp9robh"><div class="fl-col-content fl-node-content"><h2  class="fl-module fl-module-heading fl-heading fl-heading-text fl-node-kvz5uwc7e4xa" data-node="kvz5uwc7e4xa" aria-label="Heading">
An Electrician that you can rely on.</h2></div></div><div class="fl-col fl-node-dn9hgci0bexm fl-col-bg-color fl-col-small" data-node="dn9hgci0bexm"><div class="fl-col-content fl-node-content"><div  class="fl-module fl-module-html fl-html fl-node-dg618akmnwti" data-node="dg618akmnwti" aria-label="HTML"><div class="swiper homeSwiper"><div class="swiper-top"><p>★★★★★ from 66 customers</p><div class="home-swiper-pagination"></div></div><div class="swiper-wrapper"><div class="swiper-slide"><h4 class="fl-module fl-module-heading fl-heading fl-heading-text">Sam Kommunuri</h4><div class="fl-module fl-module-rich-text fl-rich-text"><p>“It's not often one would come across someone like Josh - professional, reliable, meticulous, pragmatic, knowledgeable, and courteous - thank you Josh!”</p></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><h4 class="fl-module fl-module-heading fl-heading fl-heading-text">Kathryn</h4><div class="fl-module fl-module-rich-text fl-rich-text"><p>“I had a lot of confidence in Josh immediately—he took the time to crawl into the roof and under the house to fully assess our electrical needs.”</p></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><h4 class="fl-module fl-module-heading fl-heading fl-heading-text">Catherine Moorhead</h4><div class="fl-module fl-module-rich-text fl-rich-text"><p>“Josh at Neon is a great communicator. Scheduled our SmartVent job promptly. Punctual to the minute on the day. Efficient on the job and explained our issues clearly.”</p></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><h4 class="fl-module fl-module-heading fl-heading fl-heading-text">Simon Foote</h4><div class="fl-module fl-module-rich-text fl-rich-text"><p>“Showed up on time. Was very friendly and professional. And didn’t rip me off. Finally a tradesman that cleans up after himself! Highly recommend.”</p></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><h4 class="fl-module fl-module-heading fl-heading fl-heading-text">Jonathan Dawson</h4><div class="fl-module fl-module-rich-text fl-rich-text"><p>“Josh was prompt on giving us a quote, and clearly explained all the work that needed to be done and how long it would all take. [...] He wasn't afraid to ask to clarify things and even fixed a mistake that was a miscommunication on our part.”</p></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><h4 class="fl-module fl-module-heading fl-heading fl-heading-text">Holly Hopman</h4><div class="fl-module fl-module-rich-text fl-rich-text"><p>“Great, prompt service thank you! Josh gave us 3 options for different ways to duct our drier and explained the pros/cons of each and answered my questions. [...] He also checked his workmanship and made sure the drier was operating effectively.”</p></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><h4 class="fl-module fl-module-heading fl-heading fl-heading-text">Donald</h4><div class="fl-module fl-module-rich-text fl-rich-text"><p>“Josh is knowledgeable, efficient, and comes up with smart solutions for tricky electrical problems.”</p></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><h4 class="fl-module fl-module-heading fl-heading fl-heading-text">Andrea Calvin</h4><div class="fl-module fl-module-rich-text fl-rich-text"><p>“I can recommend Josh Taylor. His work is of the highest quality and he is careful to operate safely and within NZ standards. He is helpful, honest and easy to work with, as well as being a great communicator.”</p></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><h4 class="fl-module fl-module-heading fl-heading fl-heading-text">Jet Pangan</h4><div class="fl-module fl-module-rich-text fl-rich-text"><p>“Josh from Neon Electrical Services installed SmartVent in our home, recommending the most cost-effective model. [...] He also demonstrated how to replace the filter independently to help us save money.”</p></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><h4 class="fl-module fl-module-heading fl-heading fl-heading-text">Harshan Jayasuriya</h4><div class="fl-module fl-module-rich-text fl-rich-text"><p>“Very professional, efficient, and high quality work! [...] The care he took to put away a towel and toothbrush [...] so they didn't get any dust on them, and of course that he left the bathroom spic and span after he was done.”</p></div></div></div><div class="swiper-bottom"><a href="" target="_self" class="fl-button swiper-button home-swiper-prev">
<span class="fl-button-text"><</span>
</a>
