Certified expertise. Exceptional results.</h2></div></div><div class="fl-col fl-node-uonc3rly504k fl-col-bg-color fl-col-small" data-node="uonc3rly504k"><div class="fl-col-content fl-node-content"><div  class="fl-module fl-module-rich-text fl-rich-text fl-node-t5yzjucavo84" data-node="t5yzjucavo84" aria-label="Text Editor"><p>I’m a Master Electrician with the qualifications, experience, and commitment to deliver safe, reliable, and top-quality electrical work every time. When you choose me, you’re choosing peace of mind and exceptional results.</p></div><div class="fl-module fl-module-button fl-node-scup8t5wfgv6 fl-button-wrap fl-button-width-auto fl-button-left" data-node="scup8t5wfgv6" aria-label="Button"><a href="/qualifications/" target="_self" class="fl-button"><span class="fl-button-text">List of qualifications</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="fl-row fl-row-full-width fl-row-bg-none fl-node-8v1l7bp6jdzi fl-row-default-height fl-row-align-center banner" data-node="8v1l7bp6jdzi"><div class="fl-row-content-wrap"><div class="fl-row-content fl-row-fixed-width fl-node-content"><div class="fl-col-group fl-node-j2b5u0hcfewr" data-node="j2b5u0hcfewr"><div class="fl-col fl-node-64brqx21dc9l fl-col-bg-color fl-col-small" data-node="64brqx21dc9l"><div class="fl-col-content fl-node-content"><h2  class="fl-module fl-module-heading fl-heading fl-heading-text fl-node-p1gsf6ycz53e" data-node="p1gsf6ycz53e" aria-label="Heading">
Your go-to Electrician for quality & trust</h2></div></div><div class="fl-col fl-node-gp7kd8ibtc5w fl-col-bg-color fl-col-small" data-node="gp7kd8ibtc5w"><div class="fl-col-content fl-node-content"><div role="figure" class="fl-module fl-module-photo fl-photo fl-photo-align-center fl-node-0q6j9mwzhb5y" data-node="0q6j9mwzhb5y" aria-label="Photo" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject"><div class="fl-photo-content fl-photo-img-jpg">
<img data-lazyloaded="1" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAMPDwwAAACwAAAAAAQABAAACAkQBADs=" decoding="async" class="fl-photo-img" data-src="https://www.neonelectrical.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/photos/josh.jpg" alt="Neon Electrical" title="Neon Electrical" loading="lazy" itemprop="image" /><noscript><img decoding="async" class="fl-photo-img" src="https://www.neonelectrical.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/photos/josh.jpg" alt="Neon Electrical" title="Neon Electrical" loading="lazy" itemprop="image" /></noscript></div></div><div  class="fl-module fl-module-rich-text fl-rich-text fl-node-085l3nmqoafk" data-node="085l3nmqoafk" aria-label="Text Editor"><p>With years of experience and a people-first approach, we take pride in delivering quality work, clear communication, and the kind of service that builds lasting trust.</p></div><div class="fl-module fl-module-button fl-node-hurb2v1wq7pk fl-button-wrap fl-button-width-auto fl-button-left" data-node="hurb2v1wq7pk" aria-label="Button"><a href="/about/" target="_self" class="fl-button"><span class="fl-button-text">About us</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="fl-row fl-row-fixed-width fl-row-bg-none fl-node-bdk9hqiwuvs2 fl-row-default-height fl-row-align-center" data-node="bdk9hqiwuvs2"><div class="fl-row-content-wrap"><div class="fl-row-content fl-row-fixed-width fl-node-content"><div class="fl-col-group fl-node-m61fkiopb7u0" data-node="m61fkiopb7u0"><div class="fl-col fl-node-avf73s8c6kpn fl-col-bg-color fl-col-small" data-node="avf73s8c6kpn"><div class="fl-col-content fl-node-content"><h2  class="fl-module fl-module-heading fl-heading fl-heading-text fl-node-ya9uq0nepzlb" data-node="ya9uq0nepzlb" aria-label="Heading">
Areas we serve</h2></div></div><div class="fl-col fl-node-tyeb51j4wxnl fl-col-bg-color fl-col-small" data-node="tyeb51j4wxnl"><div class="fl-col-content fl-node-content"><div  class="fl-module fl-module-rich-text fl-rich-text fl-node-pu5myx7l2vhj" data-node="pu5myx7l2vhj" aria-label="Text Editor"><p>Neon Electrical provides trusted electrical services Auckland-wide. As a <a href="https://www.neonelectrical.co.nz/qualifications/">qualified</a> and experienced <a href="https://www.neonelectrical.co.nz/electrician-auckland/">electrician Auckland</a> homeowners and businesses rely on, we’re based in Otahuhu and proudly serve the wider region. Whether you need a quick repair, a safety upgrade, or a full renovation, our team delivers reliable, high-quality work across South, East, West, and Central Auckland.</p><p><a href="https://www.neonelectrical.co.nz/electrician-south-auckland/"><strong>South Auckland</strong></a><br />
<a href="https://www.neonelectrical.co.nz/electrician-otahuhu/">Otahuhu</a>, <a href="https://www.neonelectrical.co.nz/electrician-mangere/">Mangere</a>, <a href="https://www.neonelectrical.co.nz/electrician-papatoetoe/">Papatoetoe</a>, Manukau, Flat Bush, Manurewa, Takanini, and Wiri.</p><p><strong>East Auckland</strong><br />
Howick, Pakuranga, Botany Downs, East Tamaki, Bucklands Beach, and Dannemora.</p><p><strong>Central Auckland</strong><br />
Onehunga, Ellerslie, Mount Wellington, Penrose, Remuera, Newmarket, and Parnell.</p><p><strong>West Auckland</strong><br />
Henderson, Te Atatu, Massey, Glen Eden, Titirangi, and <a href="https://www.neonelectrical.co.nz/electrician-new-lynn/">New Lynn</a>.</p><p><strong>North Shore</strong><br />
Takapuna, Albany, Glenfield, Northcote, Milford, and Devonport.</p></div><div class="fl-module fl-module-button fl-node-x84t3fnz7lhs fl-button-wrap fl-button-width-auto fl-button-left" data-node="x84t3fnz7lhs" aria-label="Button"><a href="https://www.neonelectrical.co.nz/electrician-auckland/" target="_self" class="fl-button"><span class="fl-button-text">Electrician in Auckland</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><section class="fl-row fl-row-full-width fl-posts fl-related"><div class="fl-row-content-wrap"><div class="fl-row-content fl-row-fixed-width"><div class="fl-col-group"><div class="fl-col"><div class="fl-col-content"><h2 class="fl-module fl-module-heading fl-heading fl-heading-text">Know how</h2></div></div><div class="fl-col"><div class="fl-col-content"><div class="fl-module fl-module-button">
